       >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COBIMP-ERROR.

DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
    COPY "compiler-state.cpy".
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMPILER-STATE.
MAIN-ERROR.
    IF CS-ERROR-LINE > 0
        DISPLAY "COMPILATION ERROR at line " CS-ERROR-LINE
          ", column " CS-ERROR-COLUMN ": "
          FUNCTION TRIM(CS-ERROR-MESSAGE)
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "COMPILATION ERROR: "
          FUNCTION TRIM(CS-ERROR-MESSAGE)
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
